 RWAN_23=A porta WAN deve ser selecionada no Dual WAN.
 RWFS_14=A senha deve ter pelo menos 10 caracteres, incluindo 1 letra, 1 caractere especial e 1 número.
 RQOS_125=This WAN jack is a VLAN on a port that also carries the wired LAN (the 2.5G WAN/LAN jack on the GT-BE98 family). Hardware QoS is not applied here: shaping that port would throttle every wired LAN port and a wired AiMesh backhaul. Use the 10G WAN port for hardware QoS, or a software engine on this jack.
+RDSH_91=LAN name resolution
+RDSH_92=working
+RDSH_93=FAILING
+RDSH_94=not checked yet
+RDSH_95=check switched off (DNS Failover page)
+RDSH_96=not checked while the WAN is down
+RDSH_97=The router's DNS service is not answering, so LAN devices cannot look up any name.
+RDSH_98=The router's DNS answers, but no upstream DNS server resolves new names.
+RDSH_99=Not answering:
+RDSH_100=The DNS servers LAN devices are given by DHCP do not resolve new names.
